      "source": {
        "id": "gdpr",
        "title": "Regulation (EU) 2016/679",
        "url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/oj/eng"
      },
      "span": "In the cases referred to in points (a) and (c) of paragraph 2, the data controller shall implement suitable measures to safeguard the data subject's rights and freedoms and legitimate interests, at least the right to obtain human intervention on the part of the controller, to express his or her point of view and to contest the decision."
